cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "urgencias-core"
abstract: >-
  Open reference pipeline for Chilean emergency department analytics,
  probabilistic forecasting, and Monte Carlo occupancy simulation: a
  visits-to-hourly-occupancy transform, Chilean calendar features, a uniform
  quantile Forecaster interface (seasonal-naive, statsforecast, LightGBM), an
  evaluation harness, an empirical-LOS Monte Carlo engine, a DEIS MINSAL
  open-data client, and a minimal reference dashboard.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Nicolás"
    family-names: "Vera Zúñiga"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-9249-3736"
    affiliation: "Eunosia, Frutillar, Chile"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-20"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/nicoveraz/urg-forecast-core"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/urgencias-core/"
keywords:
  - emergency department
  - emergency medicine
  - forecasting
  - time series
  - Monte Carlo simulation
  - capacity planning
  - Chile
  - DEIS
